{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cWar takes everything from us \u2014 yet sometimes, it gives us someone to protect.\u201d</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A Forgotten Front. A Lost Child. A Fading Hope.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallipoli Trenches: The Forgotten Front</strong> is a deeply emotional, story-driven 2D adventure set during the Gallipoli Campaign of World War I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Captain Timur</strong>, a young Ottoman officer serving under <strong>Mustafa Kemal Atat\u00fcrk</strong>, whose mission takes an unexpected turn when he discovers a lone surviving child in a devastated village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by duty and compassion, Timur must guide the girl through the chaos of collapsing trenches, burning hillsides, and shattered souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by real events of the Gallipoli Campaign, <i>Gallipoli Trenches</i> captures the forgotten human stories of World War I from the Ottoman front.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/2ba3deb38bdf14a13fec00980024ef49.poster.avif?t=1765389677\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/2ba3deb38bdf14a13fec00980024ef49.webm?t=1765389677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/2ba3deb38bdf14a13fec00980024ef49.mp4?t=1765389677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A Cinematic 2D Journey Through History</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the sun-scorched cliffs of Gallipoli to the rain-soaked tunnels beneath the front lines, relive one of the most unforgettable moments of the First World War.<br>With hand-drawn visuals, historical depth, and emotional storytelling, <i>Gallipoli Trenches</i> brings history to life through the eyes of ordinary people caught in extraordinary times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/e424f6927ba4ac02a571be5f6e41d601.poster.avif?t=1765389677\" aria-label=\"Gallipoli_Trenches4\" width=696 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/e424f6927ba4ac02a571be5f6e41d601.webm?t=1765389677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/e424f6927ba4ac02a571be5f6e41d601.mp4?t=1765389677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Experience Humanity Amid Destruction</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Captain Timur and the child through the remnants of war \u2014 evade patrols, solve environmental puzzles, and survive gas fields and bombardments.<br>Through moments of silence, kindness, and sacrifice, discover that even in war, humanity remains the strongest weapon of all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Post-Release Plans</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Free Challenge Mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Historical Scenes Update\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack Release</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131480?t=1765389677","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/6362bf072650454e8ddc24c88f94edbff5460f5f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765389677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/567984ed1b037abc65ed5d287d9e77f8